    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the unique world of Kaido Genkai \u2013 an open-world racing exploration game that blends the excitement of high-speed races with the charm of anime-style graphics. Set in a nostalgic 90's fictional Japanese countryside, Kaido Genkai invites you to explore a vibrant world filled with unique characters and hidden treasures. As an RPG, this game offers more than just racing; it\u2019s an adventure where you learn about your past, challenge rivals, and unlock an array of unique cars, each with their own set of liveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through lush landscapes in a riverside town to discover all it has to offer, all passionately designed to capture the essence of 90's Japan. The open-world environment is rich with secrets waiting to be discovered. Whether you're competing in high-stakes races or leisurely exploring the countryside, Kaido Genkai promises exploration, racing, and adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113580/extras/cf3adb487c7df633b8f54aed267c9d21.avif?t=1748881725\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An open-world reimagining of the Japanese countryside</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a gripping narrative that dives into a mysterious past</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet unforgettable characters\u2014rivals, allies, and local legends</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced arcade racing fused with  RPG progression </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover hidden shortcuts, jumps and secret areas</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tackle a variety of  race types</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose from 19 distinct vehicles, each with  custom variations</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic day-night cycle\u00a0featuring stylized lighting and effects</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a work in progress by a solo developer. Release date TBD.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the unique world of Kaido Genkai \u2013 an open-world racing exploration game that blends the excitement of high-speed races with the charm of anime-style graphics. Set in a nostalgic 90's fictional Japanese countryside, Kaido Genkai invites you to explore a vibrant world filled with unique characters and hidden treasures. As an RPG, this game offers more than just racing; it\u2019s an adventure where you learn about your past, challenge rivals, and unlock an array of unique cars, each with their own set of liveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through lush landscapes in a riverside town to discover all it has to offer, all passionately designed to capture the essence of 90's Japan. The open-world environment is rich with secrets waiting to be discovered. Whether you're competing in high-stakes races or leisurely exploring the countryside, Kaido Genkai promises exploration, racing, and adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113580/extras/cf3adb487c7df633b8f54aed267c9d21.avif?t=1748881725\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An open-world reimagining of the Japanese countryside</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a gripping narrative that dives into a mysterious past</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet unforgettable characters\u2014rivals, allies, and local legends</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced arcade racing fused with  RPG progression </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover hidden shortcuts, jumps and secret areas</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tackle a variety of  race types</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose from 19 distinct vehicles, each with  custom variations</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic day-night cycle\u00a0featuring stylized lighting and effects</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a work in progress by a solo developer. Release date TBD.</p>",
